      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Not a lot of depth to the exposed form in this maiden. PARTING THE SEAS (2) settled just behind the speed then went to the line fairly first-up over this distance at Grafton. Given a 30-day freshen up since that return. Big chance to break through with any natural improvement off that first-up effort. DELLUCY (4) wasn't all that far away first-up at Grafton then missed the frame in a pretty plain affair at Ballina last time. Just three placings from 21 runs but a small interest at massive odds is worthwhile. KOBI EXPRESS (1) showed pace but knocked up at Taree recently over today's journey. Raced once on a heavy track back in June and finished a close second at Coffs Harbour. Any further improvement in track condition won't help his prospects. The rest of the field are first starters with varying results at the trials. ALEXANDRA PARADE (8) with blinkers going straight on, SUNNY SIDE STREET (10), and PRESTIGE SPECIAL (7) look the pick of them.",
